  "_comment": "Registrables that are legitimately brand-owned. Anything matching here is DROPPED before scoring and never persisted to the certs table (it still counts in issuance_daily and registrables). Without this file, every legitimate renewal of dbs.com.sg scores 40 and buries the real signal.",
  "version": 1,
